#! case: a % quantity lies in (0, 100]
#! rule: R18_04-wrong-quantity
#! regia: 2.0

GAME CUE toast_raised
ACTION cheer

PLOT Banquet:
    ROLE Guest.
    PHASE reception INITIAL.

    DURING reception:
        WHEN toast_raised, FROM 150% OF Guest:     #! error R18_04-wrong-quantity
            DO cheer.
